    },
    {
        "type": "table",
        "img_path": "images/a0fedbf32e61bee34547c9754d2c2f5e8709f280adbc1368995e229439495351.jpg",
        "table_caption": [],
        "table_footnote": [],
        "table_body": "<table><tr><td>学习目标:【先将电路背景,在引出学习目标】(1)双零法的求解(2)完全响应的分解与关联</td></tr></table>",
        "bbox": [
