    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、 $r_{zi}^{(k)}(0_{+})$ 的求解说明",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            108,
            369,
            129
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $r_{zi}(t)$ 与激励无关，说明 $r_{zi}(t)$ 的0-到0+无跳变，即 $r_{zi}^{(k)}(0_{+})=r_{zi}^{(k)}(0_{-})$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            136,
            752,
            155
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 完全响应 $r(t)=$ 零状态响应 $r_{zs}(t)+$ 零输入响应 $r_{zi}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            163,
            608,
            179
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr ^ {(k)} (0 _ {-}) = r _ {z s} ^ {(k)} (0 _ {-}) + r _ {z i} ^ {(k)} (0 _ {-})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            378,
            186,
            615,
            207
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "而",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            214,
            208,
            228
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr _ {z s} ^ {(k)} (0 _ {-}) = 0\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            445,
            238,
            549,
            258
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "故",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            264,
            208,
            277
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr _ {z i} ^ {(k)} (0 _ {+}) = r _ {z i} ^ {(k)} (0 _ {-}) = r ^ {(k)} (0 _ {-})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            366,
            280,
            643,
            311
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)求 $r_{zi}(t)$ 齐次解形式中待定系数用 $r^{(k)}(0_{-})$ 或 $r_{zi}^{(k)}(0_{+})$ 或 $r_{zi}^{(k)}(0_{-})$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            315,
            690,
            334
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 15: 描述某LTI系统的微分方程为",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            364,
            473,
            378
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {d ^ {2} r (t)}{d t ^ {2}} + 3 \\frac {d r (t)}{d t} + 2 r (t) = 2 \\frac {d e (t)}{d t} + 6 e (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            329,
            388,
            663,
            421
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知 $r(0_{-})=2,\\quad r'(0_{-})=0,\\quad e(t)=u(t)$ ，求该系统的零输入响应。",
