    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 4: 完全响应分解及其关联",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            109,
            482,
            127
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "描述某 LTI 系统的微分方程为",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            138,
            421,
            153
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {d ^ {2} r (t)}{d t ^ {2}} + 3 \\frac {d r (t)}{d t} + 2 r (t) = 2 \\frac {d e (t)}{d t} + 6 e (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            327,
            161,
            662,
            195
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知 $r(0_{-})=2,r'(0_{-})=0,e(t)=u(t)$ ，求该系统的完全响应。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            200,
            670,
            217
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由经典法③⑤跳代结果为：",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            235,
            411,
            251
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "特解为： $r_p(t) = 3u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            258,
            374,
            276
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "完全响应为： $r(t)=(-e^{-2t}+3)u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            285,
            487,
            302
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "自由响应为： $r_h(t) = r(t) - r_p(t) = -e^{-2t}u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            309,
            556,
            328
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由双零法得到的结果为:",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            347,
            386,
            363
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "零输入响应为： $r_{zi}(t) = (4e^{-t} - 2e^{-2t})u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            372,
            532,
            389
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "零状态响应为： $r_{zs}(t) = (-4e^{-t} + e^{-2t} + 3)u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            397,
            569,
            415
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "完全响应为： $r(t)=r_{zi}(t)+r_{zs}(t)=(-e^{-2t}+3)u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            423,
            615,
            441
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、系统的完全响应 $r(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            467,
            373,
            483
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)经典法：完全响应(全解)=自由响应(齐次解)+强迫响应(特解)",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            494,
            707,
            510
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (t) = r _ {h} (t) + r _ {p} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            433,
            517,
            561,
            536
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)双零法：完全响应=零输入响应+零状态响应",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            546,
            564,
            562
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (t) = r _ {z i} (t) + r _ {z s} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            431,
            568,
            564,
            589
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)完全响应=稳态响应+暂态响应(瞬态响应)(PS: 当 $t \\rightarrow \\infty$ 时趋于 0 的部分为暂态，剩余为稳态)",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            596,
            810,
            638
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(4)关系：",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            646,
            260,
            662
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} r (t) & = \\boxed {r _ {h} (t) + r _ {p} (t)} \\\\ & = r _ {z i} (t) + r _ {z s h} (t) + r _ {z s p} (t) \\\\ & \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\quad \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            374,
            665,
            638,
            745
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaoyan.com",
        "bbox": [
            159,
            881,
            371,
            897
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
