    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、完全响应求解流程",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            109,
            363,
            124
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "①双零法 $r_{zi}(t)$ 和 $r_{zs}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            133,
            366,
            150
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "② $r(t)=r_{zi}(t)+r_{zs}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            157,
            369,
            175
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "③根据各关系指出其它响应",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            182,
            406,
            198
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 17：求解系统完全响应，并指出系统的自由响应，强迫响应，零输入响应、零状态响应、稳态响应和暂态响应。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            229,
            801,
            270
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 4 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 y (t) = f (t), y (0 _ {-}) = y ^ {\\prime} (0 _ {-}) = 1, f (t) = u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            252,
