    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 18: 求解系统完全响应，并指出系统的自由响应、强迫响应、零输入响应、零状态响应。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            801,
            149
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 4 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 4 y (t) = f ^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 f (t), y (0 _ {-}) = 1, y ^ {\\prime} (0 _ {-}) = 2, f (t) = e ^ {- t} u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            157,
            808,
            176
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
